<title>UK: Goldman sets warrants on European share basket.</title>
<headline>Goldman sets warrants on European share basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on the GS European Restructuring Basket 3, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co oHG said.</p>
<p>The basket consists of shares of Elf Aquitaine SA, Hoechst AG, Bayerische Hypothekenbank AG, VEBA AG, Unilever NV, Philips Electronics NV, Novartis AG, Zurich Insurance, Guinness Plc and Credito Italiano SpA</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,000 DEM		 PREMIUM	12.25 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.225 DEM		 GEARING	8.16 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.JUN.97-11.DEC.98   PAYDATE	27.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUES/FFT/STUT	   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,000 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
